    "solution": "f(2): computes 10 // 2 = 5; the return value is set, finally prints 'cleanup', then 5 is returned - prints just 'cleanup'. f(0): raises ZeroDivisionError; except prints 'caught'; finally prints 'cleanup'; the function returns None. Order: cleanup / caught / cleanup."
